  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audited financial verification of CIR&apos;s expenses from 2014 to 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2015, an external financial verification of CIR&apos;s expenses from 2014 to 2015 and financial capacity within CIR&apos;s coordination team was carried out by an external accountant. 
This piece of work revealed serious concerns on financial mismanagement of 2014-2015 funds and together with CIR it was decided to carry on an audited verification of CIR&apos;s expenses and balances.</narrative>
  </description>
